# Codemod Recipe

This workspace uses **codemod-recipe** for deterministic AST edits via sandboxed Luau recipes and the Rust MCP server (`codemod-mcp`).

## Modes (agents)

| Mode | When | Skill |
|------|------|-------|
| **Architect** | Create/modify recipes, components, queries, templates | `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/architect/` |
| **Builder** | Understand workspace or apply recipes/components | `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/builder/` |

Usage docs SSOT: [`docs/usage/`](docs/usage/) (symlink at `.agents/skills/codemod-recipe/docs`). Skills are thin indexes — do not add fat `reference.md` encyclopedias. Skills are edited only under `.agents/skills/` (no `export/.agents/` copy). Bootstrap sources: [`export/bootstrap.toml`](export/bootstrap.toml).

## MCP

- `preview_recipe` before `apply_recipe` (`previewToken`)
- Components: `component_dry_run_hook` before `component_apply_hook`
- Top skill: `codemod-recipe`

## Maintainer docs (this repo only)

Follow **[docs/develop/01_documentation_system/00_index.md](docs/develop/01_documentation_system/00_index.md)**. Skill: `codemod-recipe-human-docs`.

Companion: codebase-memory-mcp for symbol locate (suggest install; do not auto-install).
